---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Services
description: "FDM and resin 3D printing, 3D design & file support, and batch & commercial orders for business and individuals."
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Bondar Labs · Services</p>
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p class="lead">From one-off functional parts to repeat commercial runs — with engineering-grade materials and careful quality checks.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      {% for s in collections.services %}
        <a class="card card-link" href="{{ s.url | url }}">
          <div class="card-media"><img src="{{ s.data.coverImage | url }}" alt="{{ s.data.coverAlt or s.data.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="kicker">{{ s.data.kicker }}</div>
            <h2 class="h3">{{ s.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="muted">{{ s.data.summary }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="card mt-16">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h3">Extra options</h2>
        <ul class="muted">
          <li><strong>Same-day local</strong>: available on request for Cambridgeshire (subject to schedule and part complexity).</li>
          <li><strong>Reverse engineering</strong>: can be included as part of file support if you only have photos/measurements.</li>
          <li><strong>Post-processing</strong>: sanding, basic finishing and assembly support available depending on the project.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/quote/' | url }}">Get a Quote</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ '/delivery/' | url }}">Delivery options</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
